 firm-target heads: 172,800 small Ridge fits, with one maximum-rank PCA reused
@@ -153,11 +153,14 @@ the 1,536 structural representations unchanged. A zero winner is at the
 mathematical endpoint; 0.001 and 0.01 are interior choices. Ranks,
 initializations, and iteration caps are unchanged. Because resource approval
 is exact-manifest bound, all four resource-pilot tasks must be rerun and
-published under the fresh manifest before broader fan-out. Gradient boosting
-completed 144 of 864 trials in about 3.3 hours, implying roughly
-20 hours at the observed pace. These are development-only pilot measurements,
